{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10528","headline":"秦中送李九赴越 · 高适","name":"秦中送李九赴越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携手望千里，于今将十年。\n如何每离别，心事复迍邅。\n适越虽有以，出关终耿然。\n愁霖不可向，长路或难前。\n吴会独行客，山阴秋夜船。\n谢家徵故事，禹穴访遗编。\n镜水君所忆，蓴羹余旧便。\n归来莫忘此，兼示济江篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}